      "text_unit_id": "tu_0002",
      "verbatim_text": "2. In patients with adult congenital heart disease and complex or sustained VA in the presence of important residual hemodynamic lesions, treatment of hemodynamic abnormalities with catheter or surgical intervention as feasible is indicated prior to consideration of ablation or an ICD (S10.8-3,S10.8-7–S10.8-12)."
